                        "entry_id": "0d7e21d7-bdfc-3a41-84f7-3e27c72ad88d",
                        "glosses": [
                            "One who believes that the cosmos is in an abnormal state that can only be set right by divine influence."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "8b7d674f-76a2-40f8-bc39-ba0aa9c64903",
                                "sense_id": "9644ceb7-7457-3881-9c4c-6782afd82fc9",
                                "text": "On the other hand, there is the worldview represented by the abnormalists, who insist that the cosmos is in an aberrant state because a fundamental disturbance has taken place in the past which can only be remedied by a regenerating power that can restore it to its original goals (theism)."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "0ff57ef4-afc3-4b33-8b60-232207778539",
                                "sense_id": "9644ceb7-7457-3881-9c4c-6782afd82fc9",
                                "text": "Abnormalists, in contrast, view the world as fundamentally broken, skewed or distorted. Christians believe that we live in an abnormal state—biologically, socially, psychologically, volitionally, emotionally—[…]"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
